<title>USA: Gunther Intl Q4 March 31 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Gunther Intl Q4 March 31 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>NORWICH, Conn. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Fiscal Year Ended</p>
<p>			 3/31/97    3/31/96     3/31/97     3/31/96</p>
<p> Revenues	 $3,151,000 $3,183,000 $14,453,000 $12,481,000</p>
<p> Net Income	  123,000	8,000     259,000   (880,000)</p>
<p> Net EPS (Loss)	 0.03	 0.00	  0.06	(0.23)</p>
<p> Wgtd Avg Shrs   4,815,107  4,125,820   4,587,275   3,897,367</p>
<p>Note: The company makes high speed automated document finishing systems. Its full name is Gunther International Ltd.</p>
